# Local source-of-truth tree for walkthrough content (personal/holiday photos).
# Mirrors what's in R2, but stays out of the public git remote.
content/
# Local artefacts. The worktree convention says `git add -A` is fine — and it
# is, with respect to other agents. It is not safe with respect to junk, so the
# junk has to be named here rather than remembered at staging time.
*.bak-*
